# Keep Go sources LF so gofmt and the `just ci` guard behave identically on
# every machine, regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf setting.
*.go text eol=lf

# The bucket manifest is generated as LF and byte-compared by
# TestBucketManifestInSync; pin it LF so a core.autocrlf=true checkout does not
# make the test report it stale.
bucket/*.json text eol=lf
